The latest release of Lyntin is always available from:

   http://lyntin.sourceforge.net/

In general, work on Lyntin progresses as time allows.  I respond to
emails on the mailing list within a day or so.  Most issues are tracked
via the bug-tracker and task-tracker on our SourceForge project site.
If you have problems and fix them, by all means send us patches and
we'll happily work with them and credit you.

That should be about it.  In-game help is accessed by typing ``#help``.
When you start Lyntin for the first time, type ``#help general``
and that'll get you started.  Read through the various help files
at your leisure.

